<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 5: </span>Architectural parameters of the Transformer backbones used in our experiments.</figcaption>
<table id="A3.T5.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
