<th id="A4.T17.4.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt">Serialization (ms)</th>
<th id="A4.T17.4.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt">BPE Encoding (ms)</th></tr>
